[ti:It Came Upon the Midnight Clear]
[ar:Traditional]
[00:00.00]It came upon the midnight clear
[00:14.00]That glorious song of old
[00:28.00]From angels bending near the earth
[00:43.00]To touch their harps of gold
[01:00.00]Peace on the earth, goodwill to men
[01:18.00]From heaven's all-gracious King
[01:31.50]The world in solemn stillness lay
[01:48.00]To hear the angels sing
